  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CoE Immediate Measures Package</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">CoE Immediate Measures Package</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development intervention&apos;s objective of the CoE Immediate Measures Package is to reinstate the respect for human rights and democracy in the wake of the recent violent events in Ukraine through legal expertise and support provision.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektf&#xF6;rslaget som presenterats av Europar&#xE5;det, &quot;Immediate Measures Package&quot;, &#xE4;r en respons p&#xE5; utvecklingen i Ukraina 2013-2014. Projektf&#xF6;rslaget inneh&#xE5;ller m&#xE5;l och aktiviteter f&#xF6;r att omg&#xE5;ende st&#xE4;rka respekten f&#xF6;r normer och processer kring demokrati och m&#xE4;nskliga r&#xE4;ttigheter. Aktiviteterna omfattar st&#xF6;d till arbetet med konstitutionen, utredningar kring brott mot m&#xE4;nskliga r&#xE4;ttigheter, processer f&#xF6;r &#xF6;kad lokal demokrati; val; samt kapacitetsutveckling av parlamentsledam&#xF6;ter.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The intervention is titled CoE Immediate Measures Package proposed in the wake of the civic protests in Ukraine over 2013-2014. The package includes the emergency actions to reinstate respect concerning the norms and procedures re democracy and human rights in a number of areas: constitutional, investigation of HR violations, local democracy, public assembly, elections, capacity building for parliamentaties.</narrative>
  </description>
